        <mxCell id="o-codes" value="&lt;b&gt;HTTP status codes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;200 OK&lt;/b&gt; - authorized; synthetic order result streamed back to the caller.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;401 Unauthorized&lt;/b&gt; - missing / invalid token at the APIM gateway (validate-azure-ad-token; no-token case emits the RFC 9728 PRM challenge via WWW-Authenticate), or Easy Auth audience / allowlist rejection at a Function App.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;403 Forbidden&lt;/b&gt; - authenticated but missing the Orders.Read app role; the MCP tool fails closed and makes no downstream call." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
